{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Seamless gutters are continuous gutters with no seams except at corners and downspout connections. We fabricate them on-site using portable equipment, cutting each run to the exact length needed.</p>

<p>This eliminates weak points where sectional gutters fail. Better performance, cleaner appearance, dramatically longer lifespan.</p>
{% endset %}

